into configs/legacy-arr/ as the hyperparameter source of truth and run provenance
for the ARR submission (exp-0616 seeds 42/43/44, exp-0625/0626 7B + no-shared).

These are the 3-epoch/30B WSD runs with decay only at the very end. They are the
BASE that configs/know-your-sources/ is derived from -- do not edit them.
